From 45376dc35d3afe57a077846db438b178ab352533 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Personal <idumych@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 13:20:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] app_server: software display rotation (personal patch)

Reads ~/config/settings/display_rotation at startup ("display right",
"left", "inverted", or 0/90/180/270). The back buffer gets the rotated
size and is copied turned into the physical frame buffer; display modes
are swapped at the HWInterface boundary so everything above it sees the
rotated screen. Hardware cursor, overlays and BDirectWindow are turned
off while rotated, screenshots read from the back buffer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WwH5PZZRHHZuu8kGTV9wBF
